e-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja517:35.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja517:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja517:0.2": "Tiṁsanipāta ", "ja517:0.3": "Kiṁchandavagga ", "ja517:0.4": "7. Dakarakkhasajātaka ", "ja517:1.1": "“Sace vo vuyhamānānaṁ, ", "ja517:1.2": "sattannaṁ udakaṇṇave; ", "ja517:1.3": "Manussabalimesāno, ", "ja517:1.4": "nāvaṁ gaṇheyya rakkhaso; ", "ja517:1.5": "Anupubbaṁ kathaṁ datvā, ", "ja517:1.6": "muñcesi dakarakkhasā”. ", "ja517:2.1": "“Mātaraṁ paṭhamaṁ dajjaṁ, ", "ja517:2.2": "Bhariyaṁ datvāna bhātaraṁ; ", "ja517:2.3": "Tato sahāyaṁ datvāna, ", "ja517:2.4": "Pañcamaṁ dajjaṁ brāhmaṇaṁ; ", "ja517:2.5": "Chaṭṭhāhaṁ dajjamattānaṁ, ", "ja517:2.6": "Neva dajjaṁ mahosadhaṁ”. ", "ja517:3.1": "“Posetā te janettī ca, ", "ja517:3.2": "dīgharattānukampikā; ", "ja517:3.3": "Chabbhī tayi padussati, ", "ja517:3.4": "paṇḍitā atthadassinī; ", "ja517:3.5": "Aññaṁ upanisaṁ katvā, ", "ja517:3.6": "vadhā taṁ parimocayi. ", "ja517:4.1": "Taṁ tādisiṁ pāṇadadiṁ, ", "ja517:4.2": "orasaṁ gabbhadhāriniṁ; ", "ja517:4.3": "Mātaraṁ kena dosena, ", "ja517:4.4": "dajjāsi dakarakkhino”. ", "ja517:5.1": "“Daharā viyalaṅkāraṁ, ", "ja517:5.2": "dhāreti apiḷandhanaṁ; ", "ja517:5.3": "Dovārike anīkaṭṭhe, ", "ja517:5.4": "ativelaṁ pajagghati. ", "ja517:6.1": "Athopi paṭirājūnaṁ, ", "ja517:6.2": "sayaṁ dūtāni sāsati; ", "ja517:6.3": "Mātaraṁ tena dosena, ", "ja517:6.4": "dajjāhaṁ dakarakkhino”. ", "ja517:7.1": "“Itthigumbassa pavarā, ", "ja517:7.2": "accantaṁ piyabhāṇinī; ", "ja517:7.3": "Anuggatā sīlavatī, ", "ja517:7.4": "chāyāva anapāyinī. ", "ja517:8.1": "Akkodhanā puññavatī, ", "ja517:8.2": "paṇḍitā atthadassinī; ", "ja517:8.3": "Ubbariṁ kena dosena, ", "ja517:8.4": "dajjāsi dakarakkhino”. ", "ja517:9.1": "“Khiḍḍāratisamāpannaṁ, ", "ja517:9.2": "anatthavasamāgataṁ; ", "ja517:9.3": "Sā maṁ sakāna puttānaṁ, ", "ja517:9.4": "ayācaṁ yācate dhanaṁ. ", "ja517:10.1": "Sohaṁ dadāmi sāratto, ", "ja517:10.2": "bahuṁ uccāvacaṁ dhanaṁ; ", "ja517:10.3": "Suduccajaṁ cajitvāna, ", "ja517:10.4": "pacchā socāmi dummano; ", "ja517:10.5": "Ubbariṁ tena dosena, ", "ja517:10.6": "dajjāhaṁ dakarakkhino”. ", "ja517:11.1": "“Yenocitā janapadā, ", "ja517:11.2": "ānītā ca paṭiggahaṁ; ", "ja517:11.3": "Ābhataṁ pararajjebhi, ", "ja517:11.4": "abhiṭṭhāya bahuṁ dhanaṁ. ", "ja517:12.1": "Dhanuggahānaṁ pavaraṁ, ", "ja517:12.2": "sūraṁ tikhiṇamantinaṁ; ", "ja517:12.3": "Bhātaraṁ kena dosena, ", "ja517:12.4": "dajjāsi dakarakkhino”. ", "ja517:13.1": "“Yenocitā janapadā, ", "ja517:13.2": "ānītā ca paṭiggahaṁ; ", "ja517:13.3": "Ābhataṁ pararajjebhi, ", "ja517:13.4": "abhiṭṭhāya bahuṁ dhanaṁ. ", "ja517:14.1": "Dhanuggahānaṁ pavaro, ", "ja517:14.2": "sūro tikhiṇamanti ca; ", "ja517:14.3": "Mayāyaṁ sukhito rājā, ", "ja517:14.4": "atimaññati dārako. ", "ja517:15.1": "Upaṭṭhānampi me ayye, ", "ja517:15.2": "na so eti yathā pure; ", "ja517:15.3": "Bhātaraṁ tena dosena, ", "ja517:15.4": "dajjāhaṁ dakarakkhino”. ", "ja517:16.1": "“Ekarattena ubhayo, ", "ja517:16.2": "tvañceva dhanusekha ca; ", "ja517:16.3": "Ubho jātettha pañcālā, ", "ja517:16.4": "sahāyā susamāvayā. ", "ja517:17.1": "Cariyā taṁ anubandhittho, ", "ja517:17.2": "ekadukkhasukho tava; ", "ja517:17.3": "Ussukko te divārattiṁ, ", "ja517:17.4": "sabbakiccesu byāvaṭo; ", "ja517:17.5": "Sahāyaṁ kena dosena, ", "ja517:17.6": "dajjāsi dakarakkhino”. ", "ja517:18.1": "“Cariyā maṁ ayaṁ ayye, ", "ja517:18.2": "pajagghittho mayā saha; ", "ja517:18.3": "Ajjāpi tena vaṇṇena, ", "ja517:18.4": "ativelaṁ pajagghati. ", "ja517:19.1": "Ubbariyāpihaṁ ayye, ", "ja517:19.2": "mantayāmi rahogato; ", "ja517:19.3": "Anāmanto pavisati, ", "ja517:19.4": "pubbe appaṭivedito. ", "ja517:20.1": "Laddhadvāro katokāso, ", "ja517:20.2": "ahirikaṁ anādaraṁ; ", "ja517:20.3": "Sahāyaṁ tena dosena, ", "ja517:20.4": "dajjāhaṁ dakarakkhino”. ", "ja517:21.1": "“Kusalo sabbanimittānaṁ, ", "ja517:21.2": "rutaññū āgatāgamo; ", "ja517:21.3": "Uppāte supine yutto, ", "ja517:21.4": "niyyāne ca pavesane. ", "ja517:22.1": "Paṭṭho bhūmantalikkhasmiṁ, ", "ja517:22.2": "Nakkhattapadakovido; ", "ja517:22.3": "Brāhmaṇaṁ kena dosena, ", "ja517:22.4": "Dajjāsi dakarakkhino”. ", "ja517:23.1": "“Parisāyampi me ayye, ", "ja517:23.2": "ummīlitvā udikkhati; ", "ja517:23.3": "Tasmā accabhamuṁ luddaṁ, ", "ja517:23.4": "dajjāhaṁ dakarakkhino”. ", "ja517:24.1": "“Sasamuddapariyāyaṁ, ", "ja517:24.2": "mahiṁ sāgarakuṇḍalaṁ; ", "ja517:24.3": "Vasundharaṁ āvasasi, ", "ja517:24.4": "amaccaparivārito. ", "ja517:25.1": "Cāturanto mahāraṭṭho, ", "ja517:25.2": "vijitāvī mahabbalo; ", "ja517:25.3": "Pathabyā ekarājāsi, ", "ja517:25.4": "yaso te vipulaṁ gato. ", "ja517:26.1": "Soḷasitthisahassāni, ", "ja517:26.2": "āmuttamaṇikuṇḍalā; ", "ja517:26.3": "Nānājanapadā nārī, ", "ja517:26.4": "devakaññūpamā subhā. ", "ja517:27.1": "Evaṁ sabbaṅgasampannaṁ, ", "ja517:27.2": "sabbakāmasamiddhinaṁ; ", "ja517:27.3": "Sukhitānaṁ piyaṁ dīghaṁ, ", "ja517:27.4": "jīvitaṁ āhu khattiya. ", "ja517:28.1": "Atha tvaṁ kena vaṇṇena, ", "ja517:28.2": "kena vā pana hetunā; ", "ja517:28.3": "Paṇḍitaṁ anurakkhanto, ", "ja517:28.4": "pāṇaṁ cajasi duccajaṁ”. ", "ja517:29.1": "“Yatopi āgato ayye, ", "ja517:29.2": "mama hatthaṁ mahosadho; ", "ja517:29.3": "Nābhijānāmi dhīrassa, ", "ja517:29.4": "anumattampi dukkaṭaṁ. ", "ja517:30.1": "Sace ca kismici kāle, ", "ja517:30.2": "maraṇaṁ me pure siyā; ", "ja517:30.3": "So me putte paputte ca, ", "ja517:30.4": "sukhāpeyya mahosadho. ", "ja517:31.1": "Anāgataṁ paccuppannaṁ, ", "ja517:31.2": "sabbamatthampi passati; ", "ja517:31.3": "Anāparādhakammantaṁ, ", "ja517:31.4": "na dajjaṁ dakarakkhino”. ", "ja517:32.1": "“Idaṁ suṇātha pañcālā, ", "ja517:32.2": "cūḷaneyyassa bhāsitaṁ; ", "ja517:32.3": "Paṇḍitaṁ anurakkhanto, ", "ja517:32.4": "pāṇaṁ cajati duccajaṁ. ", "ja517:33.1": "Mātu bhariyāya bhātucca, ", "ja517:33.2": "sakhino brāhmaṇassa ca; ", "ja517:33.3": "Attano cāpi pañcālo, ", "ja517:33.4": "channaṁ cajati jīvitaṁ. ", "ja517:34.1": "Evaṁ mahatthikā paññā, ", "ja517:34.2": "nipuṇā sādhucintinī; ", "ja517:34.3": "Diṭṭhadhammahitatthāya, ", "ja517:34.4": "samparāyasukhāya cā”ti. ", "ja517:35.1": "Dakarakkhasajātakaṁ sattamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja517:0.1": "", "ja517:0.2": "", "ja517:0.3": "", "ja517:0.4": "", "ja517:1.1": "", "ja517:1.2": "", "ja517:1.3": "", "ja517:1.4": "", "ja517:1.5": "", "ja517:1.6": "dakarakkhasā → dakarakkhino (bj); dakarakkhato (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja517:2.1": "dajjaṁ → dajja (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja517:2.2": "", "ja517:2.3": "", "ja517:2.4": "", "ja517:2.5": "", "ja517:2.6": "", "ja517:3.1": "", "ja517:3.2": "", "ja517:3.3": "padussati → paduṭṭhasmiṁ (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja517:3.4": "", "ja517:3.5": "", "ja517:3.6": "", "ja517:4.1": "tādisiṁ → tādisaṁ (bj, mr) ", "ja517:4.2": "gabbhadhāriniṁ → gabbhadhāriṇiṁ (bj); gabbhadhārinaṁ (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja517:4.3": "", "ja517:4.4": "dakarakkhino → dakarakkhato (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja517:5.1": "", "ja517:5.2": "", "ja517:5.3": "", "ja517:5.4": "pajagghati → sañjagghati (mr) ", "ja517:6.1": "", "ja517:6.2": "", "ja517:6.3": "", "ja517:6.4": "", "ja517:7.1": "", "ja517:7.2": "accantaṁ piyabhāṇinī → accantapiyavādinī (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja517:7.3": "Anuggatā → anubbatā (sya1ed, sya2ed); anupubbatā (mr) ", "ja517:7.4": "", "ja517:8.1": "puññavatī → paññavatī (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja517:8.2": "", "ja517:8.3": "", "ja517:8.4": "", "ja517:9.1": "", "ja517:9.2": "", "ja517:9.3": "", "ja517:9.4": "", "ja517:10.1": "sāratto → sārato (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja517:10.2": "", "ja517:10.3": "", "ja517:10.4": "", "ja517:10.5": "", "ja517:10.6": "", "ja517:11.1": "janapadā → jānapadā (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) | Yenocitā → mayocitā (bj); mayācitā (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja517:11.2": "", "ja517:11.3": "", "ja517:11.4": "", "ja517:12.1": "", "ja517:12.2": "", "ja517:12.3": "", "ja517:12.4": "", "ja517:13.1": "", "ja517:13.2": "", "ja517:13.3": "", "ja517:13.4": "", "ja517:14.1": "", "ja517:14.2": "tikhiṇamanti ca → tikhiṇamantino (mr) ", "ja517:14.3": "Mayāyaṁ → mayā so (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja517:14.4": "", "ja517:15.1